      "content": "thanks but \"integrity\" doesn't pay the bills or fix the fact that my entire life is basically ruined now. it feels like a sick joke. i was so naive to think the truth mattered. it's like no matter how hard you try to be a good person, the world just finds a way to punish you for it. why should anyone bother fighting a system that's this broken? it's just exhausting to exist in a world that works like this.",
